            "block_content": "6. Company-sponsored plan means a group health care or dental plan approved by Boeing or one of its subsidiaries or affiliates for its employees and dependents. This includes the Traditional Medical Plan, coordinated care plans, health maintenance organizations, Preferred Dental Plan, Prepaid Dental Plan, and Scheduled Dental Plan.",
